---

<section id="engagements" class="py-20 md:py-32 bg-[#151923]/50">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6">
    
    <div class="mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white mb-4 uppercase">
        Community & <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-400 to-emerald-400">Engagements</span>
      </h2>
      <div class="w-20 h-1.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-500 to-emerald-500 rounded-full"></div>
      <p class="mt-6 text-gray-400 text-lg leading-relaxed">
        A timeline of my involvement in hackathons, student organizations, and tech communities.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="relative border-l border-gray-700/50 ml-3 md:ml-6 space-y-12">

      <div class="relative pl-8 md:pl-12 group">
        <div class="absolute w-4 h-4 bg-[#1e2330] border-2 border-emerald-500 rounded-full -left-[9px] top-1.5 group-hover:bg-emerald-500 group-hover:shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(16,185,129,0.5)] transition-all duration-300"></div>
        
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between mb-2 gap-2">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">Startup Pitch & Development</h3>
          <span class="text-sm font-medium text-emerald-400 bg-emerald-500/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-emerald-500/20 w-max">2025 - Present</span>
        </div>
        <h4 class="text-md font-medium text-gray-300 mb-3">Project A.N.I. & StayNet</h4>
        <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
          Actively developing and conceptualizing AI-driven agricultural platforms and local housing solutions. Engaging in the startup ecosystem to turn innovative ideas into viable software products.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="relative pl-8 md:pl-12 group">
        <div class="absolute w-4 h-4 bg-[#1e2330] border-2 border-blue-500 rounded-full -left-[9px] top-1.5 group-hover:bg-blue-500 group-hover:shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(59,130,246,0.5)] transition-all duration-300"></div>
        
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between mb-2 gap-2">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white group-hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors">Founder & President</h3>
          <span class="text-sm font-medium text-blue-400 bg-blue-500/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-blue-500/20 w-max">2024</span>
        </div>
        <h4 class="text-md font-medium text-gray-300 mb-3">4-H Club, USTP-CDO</h4>
        <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
          Founded and led the 4-H Club chapter at the University of Science and Technology of Southern Philippines. Organized initiatives, managed team dynamics, and spearheaded community-focused agricultural and youth engagements.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="relative pl-8 md:pl-12 group">
        <div class="absolute w-4 h-4 bg-[#1e2330] border-2 border-purple-500 rounded-full -left-[9px] top-1.5 group-hover:bg-purple-500 group-hover:shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(168,85,247,0.5)] transition-all duration-300"></div>
        
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between mb-2 gap-2">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white group-hover:text-purple-400 transition-colors">Graphic Designer & Social Media Manager</h3>
          <span class="text-sm font-medium text-purple-400 bg-purple-500/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-purple-500/20 w-max">2023 - 2025</span>
        </div>
        <h4 class="text-md font-medium text-gray-300 mb-3">University Student Government</h4>
        <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
          Served as the creative lead for the USG, designing visual assets, managing digital presence, and effectively communicating student events and government initiatives to the broader university population.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>